window.products.push({"id":691146,"name":"Spolehli 360 Degree Photography Photo Studio Speed Adjustable Rotating Jewelry Display Stand Electric Motorized Rotating Turntable Display Stand 7.67 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ipi8gNGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spolehli Features 1: Suitable for Display Collectibles , Jewelry, Watch, Digital Camera , Cosmetic ,Shampoo, Glass, Bag, Models, Diecast and more. 2: Speed regulation for 1st and 2nd gears is 1-2 revolutions per minute respectively. 3: The maximum bearing capacity is 22 LB depending on the rotating speed. 4: Forward and reverse rotation function. 5: Set the round-trip rotation function according to the rotation angle.The round-trip rotation angles can be set to 45/90/180/360 degrees respectively. 6: There are four power supply modes to choose from: USB direct insertion AC power supply, USB charging treasure power supply, three ordinary AA batteries (NOT RECOMMEND), 18650 rechargeable lithium battery . Specification 1.Diameter: 7.67in (195mm) 2.Height: 1.57in (40 mm) 3.Net weight: 0.55lb (0.25kg) 4.Gross weight:0.66lb (0.3kg) 5.Package quantity: 60PCS 6.Power On: touch any keys 7.R/L: switch to clockwise or counterclockwise 7. SR: speed regulation, 1r/2r/min 8. ASA: angle regulation, 45°/90°/180°/360° circulation 9. IN 5V: Micro USB 5V DC IN 10. Power Off: long press any keys for 3 seconds 11. Charge LED indicator(built-in): red-charging, green-fully charged Note Battery is not included. Ordinary AA batteries can ONLY SUPPORT one MINUTE. 1865 lithium battery and usb charging are recommended. Please take off the batteries when plug it in, otherwise the ordinary battery will heat inside and damage the motor. We provide one YEAR warranty for every our customer. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us directly. We will give you a reply as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ipi8gNGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spolehli","source_asin":"B0867QQQ7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0867QQQ7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0867QQQ7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
