window.products.push({"id":691206,"name":"Pizza Peel Tool Set-Three Piece- Includes 12” x 12” Black Matte Finish Light Weight Aluminum Peel, Foldable Wooden Handle with Rotating Knob, Pizza Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jMvXgus3L._AC_.jpg","description":"This is an elegant black matte finish pizza peel tool set offering an effortlessly easy handling. This product can accommodate a wide range of pizza sizes. It is lightweight yet sturdy and the foldable handle feature allows for convenient storage. This is a multi-purpose tool serving most of your baking needs. It comes with a shovel and a pizza cutter and a blade cover. The matte aluminum surface offers superior performance as it can slide under the most delicate dough. Make it a wonderful gift for your loved ones: Unlike other pizza tool set, this particular matte finish product looks classy and its superior quality make makes it more desirable. When gifted, it will certainly bring smile on the face of your loved ones. If you or someone dear to you, is naturally gifted with an inclination towards culinary art, then surely this will make a wonderful asset in your kitchen inventory. We are confident that you will be highly satisfied with this tool set and will continue to bring similar quality products in future to provide you the finest culinary experience. How to safely use and take care of this pizza tool set for a longer life? 1. Always make sure that the bolt connecting the paddle and the wooden handle is secured tightly. 2. Always use the blade cover when storing and keep it away from the reach of children. 3. Always remove the blade cover carefully and gently. One of the sides of cover has a slit for easy slide. 4. Do not clean this tool set in dishwasher. Try to hand-wash it delicately with a regular dishwashing detergent and a piece of cloth or cleaning sponge. 5. Do not use metal scrubber or any other kind of abrasive scrubber. 6. Wipe it carefully before storing. 7. Do not cut pizzas over the paddle as it can scratch the surface. 8. Always sprinkle dry flour on the paddle before placing the pizza dough to avoid sticking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jMvXgus3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adorys","source_asin":"B09JML4RPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JML4RPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JML4RPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
