window.products.push({"id":691500,"name":"Electric Food Dehydrator Machine, Godmorn Multi-Tier Food Preserver with Digital Timer & Temperature Control from 95ºF to 158ºF for Beef Jerky, Dried ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IS0Uj+SqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Adjustable Thermostat】The thermostat of this food dehydrator have 8 adjustable temperature from 95 to 158° F. Built-in timer can achieve up to 72 hours programme. The accurate temperature setting allows you to dry out different types of food at proper temperatures. A perfect way to preserve foods, with no additives or preservatives. 【360° Wind Circulation System & See-through Trays】The newest circulation system makes airflow go through every inch of tray and guarantee of even heat. The hot air is forced across each individual tray, converging at the top for fast, even and nutritious drying. No flavor mixing and no need to rotate trays. Transparent trays allow you to monitor drying progress on each tray. 【Low Energy Usage & Easy to Clean】This food dehydrator is low energy consumption (230w) , and you don't need to worry about using much electricity. Removable non-stick trays are fully immiscible and dishwasher-safe, making clean-up as easy as possible. (Note: the main body of this device must be put in dry place and cannot be washed.) 【5 Stackable ABS Trays】This food dehydrator equipt 5 stackable Trays with 9.8\"X12.5\" (25X31.8CM) size and they are BPA-free. The big capacity allow you to dry various food at same time. There are 0.6\"/1.27cm & 1\"/2.54cm two different interlayer spacing by changing stacking ways, which make food dryer suit for different foods. 【100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE】Our Godmorn Electric Food Dehydrator Machine Will Not Let You Down! If you are not satisfied with, just contact us and You Will be Offered a FULL Refund or Replacement!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IS0Uj+SqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Godmorn","source_asin":"B07CZWVJ2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZWVJ2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZWVJ2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
