window.products.push({"id":691521,"name":"Artistone Citrine Crystal Pumpkin Figurines Carved Gemstone Pumpkin Decor Statue Healing Stones for Halloween Decorations Thanksgiving Table Desk Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c+e8jOQtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Citrine Crystals Pumpkin: Citrine is a popular type of quartz crystal often used to in conjunction with feng shui to welcome abundance, prosperity, and positivity. Also it represents spiritual joy since it spreads positive, energetic light around its aura. Gemstone Pumpkin Size: Approx 1.5 inch height,1.5 inch width,which shows detailed, and lifelike. The citrine crystal pumpkin figurines are good as pocket stone,worry stone,energy stone,lucky stone,fengshui tool,paperweight,bookend,healing reiki stone and more. Carved Crystal Pumpkin: Each crystal pumpkin statue is unique and hand carved. Due to the nature of the citrine crystal stone and handmade craftsmanship, please allow slight changes in color,size,shape,and texture. Pumpkin Decor: Citrine crystal pumpkin figurine is essential desktop decoration for Halloween, a perfect gift for kids and adult. Not only for Halloween decorations, but also for Thanksgiving day, Birthday, Christmas. Very cute and nice home decorating accessories to impress your guests and enhance party atmosphere. Pumpkin Gifts: Comes with a beautiful gift box, easy to store and ready for giving. The customized box can ensure the citrine crystal stone pumpkin collectible figurine was not easy damage in transportation and arrive in good condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c+e8jOQtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artistone","source_asin":"B09K7FVGG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7FVGG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7FVGG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
