window.products.push({"id":691666,"name":"21oz Protein Shaker Bottle with Powder Storage Container-Shaker Cups for Protein Shakes-pre workout bottle-Mixer Cup-Gym Sport Water Bottle -Made with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mg0ezZIiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Shaker Bottle with Protein Powder Storage Compartment】：Want to easily supplement your protein intake anytime, anywhere? This shaker bottle is your best choice! Not only is it convenient to carry, but it also comes with a protein powder storage compartment, allowing you to add protein powder to your drink anytime, anywhere, and meet your nutritional needs. Whether you're at home, in the office, or at the gym, this shaker bottle can easily meet your needs. 【Shaker Bottle Come With a Pill/Calcium Compartment】:Want to be able to take your medication or calcium supplements on-the-go? This shaker bottle is the perfect choice for you! Not only is it convenient to carry, but it also features a pill/calcium compartment, allowing you to easily access your medication or supplements anytime, anywhere. This shaker cup is suitable for anyone, especially those who need to take medication or supplement their calcium intake daily. 【Made with Tritan-BPA Free】：The TRITAN material is BPA-free, which means it won't release harmful chemicals to contaminate your food and beverages. It's also easy to clean and can be washed in the dishwasher for convenience and efficiency. Not only is it safe and reliable, but it also features a strong seal that prevents leaks and is highly resistant to impact, making it sturdy and durable. It's the best choice for your everyday use. 【620ML/21oz The Double Scale Marking】:Our water bottle has a capacity of 620 ML/21oz, which is large enough to hold plenty of water and other beverages, so you don't have to constantly refill it while you're on the go. Additionally, our water bottle features convenient measurement markings, allowing you to easily control your water intake and ensure that your body is properly hydrated every day 【High-quality Wire Whisk Balls】:Our protein shaker bottle comes equipped with a high-quality Wire Whisk Balls. When you add it to the shaker bottle, it quickly and evenly blends protein powder and other ingredients, preventing clumps or particles, and ensuring that your drink is smooth and delicious. 【Suitable Occasions】:Our water bottle is suitable for various occasions, including home, office, travel, sports venues, and more. It features a strong seal that prevents leaks, allowing you to use it wherever you like with peace of mind. 【 We offer comprehensive after-sales service for our water bottles】:If you encounter any issues during the purchase process or are unsatisfied with our products, please feel free to contact our customer service team. We will make every effort to address your concerns and provide you with the best solution possible. We are committed to providing customers with the highest quality products and services to ensure a pleasant and satisfactory shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mg0ezZIiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"youcanplato","source_asin":"B0C2TG6J3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2TG6J3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2TG6J3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
