window.products.push({"id":691683,"name":"WACACO Nanopresso Portable Espresso Maker Bundled with Protective Case, Upgrade Version of Minipresso, 18 Bar Pressure, Portable Travel Coffee Maker, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vtngWkGCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As fascinating as intriguing, the unique edgy and sarcastic skull symbols, emphasize the exceptional espresso quality delivered by the Nanopresso. A drink with killer sensations where coffee's body and aromas are just out of this world. Decorated with an elegant enamel patch and embellished with fine golden-colored lines all around its body, its luxurious finishing seduces. The Dark Souls illustration is created by Wacaco Design Team with the help of the French Designer/Artist SteF. BE YOUR OWN BARISTA - Achieving the perfect espresso shot is far from easy. The Nanopresso works best with finely ground coffee that is tamped hard. Thanks to its innovative construction and easy operation, Nanopresso will help you brew perfect espresso with a nice and dense cream layer every time. GET THE BEST FROM IT - No battery/electricity need. Manual operation only! Experience the pleasure of drinking high quality espresso, from the first sip to the last drop, wherever you are. All you need for your next espresso is ground coffee, hot water and the Nanopresso machine. COMES WITH PROTECTIVE CASE - Nanopresso S-Case (185x77x72mm / 7.23x3.05x2.85in) is made of durable EVA material and soft fabric interior lining. It is specially designed to fit around the Nanopresso without any attached accessories. The case helps protect it from any bumps, scratches and dust. EASY TO CLEAN - After each shot, Nanopresso maintenance takes only few seconds. When necessary, every components of the portafilter are easily separated for deep cleaning. If you have any problem with our products or need help, please feel free to contact us through Amazon. We will respond you in time and give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vtngWkGCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WACACO","source_asin":"B0BGC2NSHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGC2NSHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGC2NSHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
