window.products.push({"id":691687,"name":"Andrea Mistretta 2000 Heineken Famous Mardi Gras Art Print New Orleans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EiVRk5cTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Andrea Mistretta has been a major influence on the popularity of Mardi Gras celebrations to other parts of the US and the rest of the world. Her Mardi Gras prints are the foundation of the most successful licensing program in Mardi Gras history. Mayor Sidney Barthelemy conferred her with the title of Honorary Citizen for promoting a positive image of Mardi Gras and New Orleans through her art. Major domestic and foreign companies have enlisted her talents to promote their products and their national recognition of Mardi Gras over the last decade. Andrea Mistretta is best known for her enchanting images annually created for Mardi Gras longest running poster series. Her work is exhibited at Disney World's Port Orleans, The Rio Hotel in Las Vegas, and Harrah's Casino in New Orleans. For two decades, Andrea Mistretta's career in art has spanned advertising, editorial and book illustration. She is the recipient of awards for her art including the prestigious Alberto Vargas award and has been featured in several international art magazines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EiVRk5cTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andrea Mistretta","source_asin":"B006YZBOX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006YZBOX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006YZBOX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
