window.products.push({"id":691991,"name":"Plastic Pantry Organization and Storage Bins with Dividers, 5 Pack Plastic Clear Storage Bins for Storing Snacks, Seasoning, Pouches, Refrigerator Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-RUvBP1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 Pack Plastic Clear Storage Bins - The acrylic clear plastic material allows you to get the contents of the pantry organized at a glance. Save time rummaging and keep everything organized. They are made of durable high quality shatterproof 100% BPA FREE material. Easy to clean with mild soap water, please do not place in the dishwasher. Snack Organizer Bins with Dividers - 3 removable dividers in each pantry organization and storage for easy separation and organization of your items, you can adjust dividers as you need. Great for separating and organizing most items in the kitchen, refrigerator, and pantry. Ideal Pantry Organization and Storage Bins - The easy-grip side handle design makes it easy to pull out. These divided bins are great for creating a clean and organized refrigerator or pantry. Ideal for kitchen storage, pantry storage, and fridge storage; Storing Snacks, Spices, Seasoning, Pouches, etc. You can use these storage organizers anywhere in your home. Multi-use Organizer Bins - These versatile storage bins can be used in any room of the home - use them in kitchens, toy rooms, craft rooms, offices, laundry/utility rooms, bedrooms, bathrooms, garages, playroom, and more; lightweight and easy to transport, these are great in apartments, dorm rooms, RVs and campers. Transparent Design & Warranty - The kitchen organizer bins are clear, so you can see what you want without having to take the whole bin out of the fridge. Simplify your home storage and make room for new. We are dedicated to addressing any product issues, if you ever have any problem, just contact us for help or a free replacement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-RUvBP1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YKIOKE","source_asin":"B0B2WBFH7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-691991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2WBFH7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2WBFH7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
